WEBVTT

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:04.490
No one's going to criticize you 
if you get excited for something,

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:07.430
or you laugh with all your heart!

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:11.850
And if someone does, I'll beat them up!

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.430
<i>Yeah. You're right...</i>

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:26.570
<i>To let my heart be moved, to laugh 
from the bottom of my heart,</i>

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:29.200
<i>to find meaning in everyday life...</i>

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:32.950
<i>I wanted to be given permission.</i>

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:20.360
<i>I saw Kou show weakness for the first time.</i>

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:27.940
<i>And now, I'm holding him in my arms...</i>

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:34.830
<i>He's so docile and cute...</i>

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:39.270
<i>I love this smell.</i>

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:42.300
<i>Kou...</i>

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:43.630
No...

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:50.150
Don't let go yet.

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:56.080
<i>Huh? What?!</i>

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:05.930
<i>I see... he doesn't want me
 to see him crying.</i>

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:11.540
<i>Is that why he hugged me 
in the first place?</i>

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:15.170
Sorry. I'm fine now.

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:17.560
Sure.

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:29.330
<i>Not good.</i>

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:35.790
<i>Right now, I've got the innocent feeling 
of wanting to be supportive of Kou.</i>

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:40.830
<i>But also the wicked feeling of wanting to see 
what he looks like right after crying.</i>

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:42.600
<i>They're all jumbled together!</i>

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:49.530
You know... when you were running 
at me, your expression was amazing.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:53.430
That's mean! Making fun of someone 
who's running their harde—

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:58.380
I wasn't making fun.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:03.580
It was kind of cool.

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:11.750
<i>In the light of the moon... 
Kou's eyelashes are sparkling.</i>

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:15.700
<i>His face, just after he's been crying...</i>

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:17.940
<i>That face...</i>

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.970
<i>I bet I'm the only one who's seen it.</i>

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:23.740
<i>It's a face he's shown only to me.</i>

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:33.190
<i>Is this... the kind of atmosphere where 
you should confess your feelings?</i>

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:25.350
Ko—

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:28.700
<b>Growl</b>

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:32.170
<b>Growl</b>

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.170
<b>Growl</b>

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:32.170
<b>Growl</b>

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:35.560
Want to grab something to eat and head home?

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:41.220
<i>Just like a couple! I feel bad 
for Yuuri, but right now...</i>

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.780
Oh, we can't.

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:50.110
Before I came here, I stopped by your house.

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:52.230
Tanaka-sensei was there.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:57.000
He's probably making dinner 
and waiting for you.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:05:59.810
Oh.

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:03.940
Tanaka-sensei...

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:09.360
Earlier, he said he thinks you resent him.

00:06:11.190 --> 00:06:15.970
Because he wasn't there 
when you needed him most.

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:21.550
Huh? We lived far away from 
each other. He couldn't help that.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:25.860
Yeah.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.990
You should tell him that.

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:32.490
Yourself. Personally.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:45.500
Later.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:49.370
Y-Yeah. Later.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:54.290
Oh! See you tomorrow!

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:58.450
Yeah, at school.

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:01.140
Sure! Later.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.770
Yoshioka!

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:13.700
Thanks.

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:17.720
Sure!

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:33.410
<i>It opened, didn't it?</i>

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:38.130
<i>It did open, didn't it? Kou's door...</i>

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:41.340
<i>He came out to where I am, right?</i>

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:50.580
<i>But even if he hasn't yet... when the 
time comes, I'll break my way in again.</i>

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.120
<i>I'll break my way in over and over again!</i>

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:15.420
<i>Running desperately to save me... 
even if she fails, over and over again...</i>

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:40.290
<b>Tanaka</b>

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:40.290
Mabuchi

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:43.120
Oh, you're back!

00:08:44.760 --> 00:08:45.770
Yeah.

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:51.560
You want dinner?

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:53.240
Eh...

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:08.920
Oh, Dad. Welcome home.

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:13.060
Oh, Youichi. You came by again?

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:23.360
Hey, Dad. It'll be ready in just a sec...

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:30.320
Well... I'm hungry. Maybe I'll join you.

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:36.570
Oh! Then get yourself some rice...

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:41.500
And chopsticks for everyone.

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:43.090
Sure.

00:09:57.630 --> 00:09:58.730
Welcome back.

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:04.570
I see.

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:14.830
Thanks for the welcome.

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:19.170
Sure.

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:25.390
Okay. Let's eat! Let's eat!

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.250
Thanks for the food!

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.760
Thanks for the food.

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:43.890
I've... been waiting 
for this day for so long...

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:51.530
When the day came, I thought I would 
greet it with a smile, but...

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:55.250
I'm a bad big brother, I guess...

00:10:58.580 --> 00:10:59.590
I...

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:02.240
When Mom died...

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:05.040
...I wasn't sure if coming back here alone...

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:07.990
...if eating dinner with you guys alone...

00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:10.000
...was okay.

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:17.140
I wasn't sure if it was okay for me to do 
the things that Mom couldn't do.

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:19.000
This whole time...

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:22.240
Kou...

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:26.430
Your mother...

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:33.980
She wasn't petty like that.

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:12.420
Ah, tonight's dinner is delicious.

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:15.520
Really delicious.

00:12:18.030 --> 00:12:20.430
Oh, we've got seconds, too.

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:23.070
Kou, you eat up too. It's good!

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:28.710
About my last name...

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:34.750
I thought I might wait a little 
to change it back.

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:40.020
It's not that I mind 
going back to Tanaka.

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:41.980
It's just...

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:48.410
Changing your last name in the middle 
of high school would get complicated.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:49.500
Yeah.

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:52.450
Right. I see.

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:56.970
You can wait until you've 
sorted out your feelings.

00:12:58.530 --> 00:13:03.870
Even if our last names differ, it doesn't 
change the fact that we're family.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:08.970
<b>Tanaka</b>

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:08.970
Mabuchi

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:08.120
Thanks, Dad.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:20.510
<i>Kou's not here yet, I guess...</i>

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:26.280
<i>Yesterday I got weirdly carried away 
and acted out, but...</i>

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:31.860
<i>When I think about it carefully, 
it was incredibly embarrassing...</i>

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:36.770
<i>Even if it turns out 
we only deepened our friendship,</i>

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.510
<i>I'm not sure how to act around Kou now...</i>

00:13:41.310 --> 00:13:42.570
<i>I wonder...</i>

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:46.410
<i>How Kou will act...</i>

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:54.640
Morning!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:03.110
<i>It looks like Kou's as self-conscious as me.</i>

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:07.380
<i>I guess that stands to reason.</i>

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:25.040
<i>What was that? It's so cute!</i>

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:27.120
<i>Does Kou really do stuff like that?</i>

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:30.690
<i>Oh, no. I'm grinning.</i>

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:34.890
You! Yesterday!

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:39.420
The way you walked out on 
us was seriously mean.

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:42.570
Yeah, I guess it was. Sorry, sorry.

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:44.690
That wasn't sincere at all.

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:47.890
Then what about today? Are you free?

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:51.780
What'd you just say?

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:55.660
I'll do the best I can, 
if it will show you I'm sincere.

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:59.150
Seriously?! I'm free today!

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:02.440
Oh, man! I'm about to cry here... 
not actually, though.

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:04.270
Do your best!

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:05.320
Sounds good.

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:11.660
We've just gotta keep you out 
of summer lessons, okay?

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.610
Leave it to us!

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.120
What's with this?

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:49.290
I was trying to make a 
show of good faith, but...

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:50.900
I feel kind of bad...

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:53.020
<b>Final Test Top Rankings

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:55.680
I ended up getting a better score 
than the people who taught me.

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:56.390
<b>8 - Saitou Chiharu
9 - Yamashita Yuuto
10 - Kojima Rie
11 - Naitou Kana
12 - Miyazaki Kazuya
13 - Abe Rei
14 - Seki Kyouhei
15 - Mabuchi Kou
16 - Tomomori Ayumi
17 - Kimura Hayato
18 - Itou Ryou
19 - Onishi Mayu</b>

00:15:56.860 --> 00:15:59.560
You're a really horrible person.

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:02.190
Wow. I'm really shocked.

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.220
Yeah. Yeah.

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:07.280
But I'm so glad! We all got up on the board!

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:08.860
That's the first time for me!

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:11.070
It was worth all the hard work, I guess.

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:12.190
I suppose.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:18.360
That's right. That means we can make plans 
for summer vacation without fear.

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:22.290
That's right! I feel like only good things 
are going to happen from now on!

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:24.710
I feel a little nervous now.

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:28.330
Touma, you're on there.

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:32.320
Oh, no way... oh, there I am!

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:35.590
<i>The guy from the library!</i>

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:40.020
<i>The pervert girl?!</i>

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:41.580
Hey, Touma!

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:44.550
Hey, wasn't that...

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:46.820
Don't say it! It's embarrassing!

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:47.800
Shh!

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:53.870
A-Anyway, only good things from 
now on! It's summer, after all!

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:55.860
Summer's here, after all!

00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:03.400
So, summer vacation starts tomorrow.

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:06.890
Try to keep it safe. Now, dismissed.

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:11.970
Hey, you want to go somewhere?

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:13.640
Sure, I'll come along!

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:16.050
We need to make plans for vacation!

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.090
That's right.

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:18.340
Hey, Kou, you...

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:21.770
Oh, Kou's gone.

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:24.460
Kou already left with his bag.

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:25.480
He's fast!

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:28.040
Oh? What about Kominato-kun?

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:29.630
My air conditioner doesn't work!

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:31.690
He's going to be a while.

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:34.770
Okay. Then let's go after him!

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:36.310
Wait, Futaba-chan!

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:39.310
I bet he hasn't even reached 
the shoe boxes yet!

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:45.540
Shuuko!

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:46.770
Shuu-chan!

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:49.670
I'll let you handle the capture of Mabuchi.

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:51.610
Got it!

00:17:51.610 --> 00:17:53.960
We'll wait by the entrance!

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:01.640
So energetic.

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:06.070
Shuuko! Shuu-chan!

00:18:10.430 --> 00:18:11.320
Futaba-chan!

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:14.620
I'm going to get serious this summer!

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:19.520
Y-Yeah, me, too!

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:22.350
Yeah!

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:24.450
Yeah!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:28.890
There he is!

00:18:28.890 --> 00:18:29.400
Kou!

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:33.210
Captured!

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.120
What?

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:44.180
That's the first time I've ever heard 
anyone call you by your first name, Murao.

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:46.280
Isn't that nice?

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:49.930
Just because I've found a place to fit in

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:54.770
doesn't mean my feelings have changed, okay?

00:18:55.770 --> 00:19:01.530
I'm sure you think you've shaken off 
one annoyance, but...

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:07.780
I don't think of you as an annoyance, though.

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.970
<i>I got careless. Not fair.</i>

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:16.600
Have a happy summer vacation!

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:21.940
Like a New Year's greeting...

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:29.880
If you let Murao get ideas in 
 her head and then hurt her,

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:33.210
you're really gonna pay for it.

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:36.870
I see.

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:42.030
So you don't mind if it ends 
in a way that doesn't hurt her?

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:47.340
Have a happy summer vacation.

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:52.500
<i>So annoying!</i>

00:19:52.510 --> 00:19:55.480
<i>I like Kou, but his brother's a jerk!</i>

00:19:56.050 --> 00:19:58.750
Oh! Kominato-kun!

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.940
Oh? What are you all doing here?

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:06.130
We're gonna stop by somewhere and 
decide what to do for summer vacation.

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:08.700
Sounds good! Let's go, let's go!

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:12.980
Like I said, we can sort that out 
through e-mail, can't we?

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:14.810
What are you talking about?

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:17.980
It's more fun if we make a lot 
of noise deciding together!

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:20.880
Yeah! That's right, Kou!

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.280
Come along gracefully.

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:24.920
Right?

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:26.460
So where should we go to decide?

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:30.880
<i>Looks like my course is 
decided for the long haul.</i>

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:32.300
Kou!

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:35.160
Let's go!

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:54.900
<i>At the start, I was alone.</i>

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:58.520
<i>But...</i>

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:05.070
<i>I decided to change.</i>

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:07.990
<i>I decided to change things.</i>

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:29.000
<i>I think I did change a little.</i>

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:34.960
<i>Spending my time with these people...</i>

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:26.200
<i>It's too soon to look back 
on old memories.</i>

00:22:27.170 --> 00:22:30.650
<i>We've only just gotten started.</i>

00:22:31.980 --> 00:22:35.610
<i>I'm going to make lots 
of memories from now on!</i>

00:23:03.800 --> 00:23:07.900
<i>From now on, I'm going to 
face straight forward,</i>

00:23:07.900 --> 00:23:10.240
<i>and walk ahead, step by step.</i>

00:23:11.690 --> 00:23:14.900
<i>Youth... a blue spring.</i>

00:23:17.760 --> 00:23:23.840
<i>With a stormy wind passing through 
my heart... on which to ride.</i>
